   "id": 531064,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/131ac46e6f785e51.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n(credit: modification of work by Tinker, M.T., et al./<i>Journal Wildlife Management</i>)\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>This graph shows the population of sea otters in a location near Alaska.</p>\n<p>Some time in the period shown by the graph, changing water temperatures reduced the population of sea urchins, which are an important food source for the sea otters. When is the most likely time this event occured?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1039572,
     "content_html": "In the year 1992."
    },
    {
     "id": 1039573,
     "content_html": "In the year 1999."
    },
    {
     "id": 1039574,
     "content_html": "In the year 2008."
    },
    {
     "id": 1039575,
     "content_html": "In the year 2010."
    }
   ],
